          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe alemweba ati, “Imwe bamuposele mu busha ukwabula ukuti balombepo kamo. Kanshi muli nokulubulwafye ukwabula ukulipililapo akantu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pantu ifi efyasosa Yawe Lesa umwine wa maka yonse ati, “Kale mwe bantu bandi mwaikele mu bweni mu calo ca Egupto, mukulekelesha abena Asiria nabo balamuteeka buluku buluku, ukwabula no mulandu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.2.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Roma 2:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe nasosa ati, “Elyo pali nomba cili shani kuli ine pano apo abantu bandi balibasenda muli bunkole ukwabula ukulombapo kamo? Elyo abo bantu bamuteeka imwe, tepakuilumbanya no kulaitutubula, kabili akasuba konse basaalula ishina lyandi no kunsuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba lino lyena, abantu bandi bakeshiba ishina lyandi, ukuti kanshi ine nine Yawe uwalandilepo libela, ee nine wine.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
